#: 9f28f8f5aca442449248f404f3d6ac5e
msgid ""
"Provides physically motivated noise generators for use as initial models in "
"simulations or fitting."
msgstr "シミュレーションやフィッティングの初期モデルとして利用可能な、物理的に裏付けられたノイズジェネレーターを提供しています。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:35
#: 9b6d3811109f45b7b243fc7ad687db56
msgid "1. Schumann Resonance (:term:`Schumann Resonance`)"
msgstr "1. シューマン共鳴 (:term:`Schumann Resonance`)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:37
#: b50327c9321946ec8ac476000f69c7ad
msgid ""
"Models magnetic noise corresponding to the resonance modes of the Earth-ionosphere "
"cavity. It reproduces the low-frequency magnetic background by superimposing multiple"
" independent Lorentzian profiles."
msgstr ""
"地球-電離層空洞の共振モードに対応する地磁気ノイズをモデル化します。 "
"複数の独立したローレンツプロファイル（Lorentzian）を重畳することで、低周波領域の磁場バックグラウンドを再現します。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:39
#: 7bced4cdb621428e99b2caabd74521e0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Related API**: {doc}`../reference/api/noise` "
"(`gwexpy.noise.magnetic.schumann_resonance`)"
msgstr "**関連 API**: {doc}`../reference/api/noise` (`gwexpy.noise.magnetic.schumann_resonance`)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:41
#: 3085de75206a4512908c2dde3dd3da5b
msgid "2. Voigt Profile"
msgstr "2. フォークト関数 (Voigt Profile)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:43
#: 0db23208c12546c1b323fdf29b16f594
msgid ""
"Generates peak shapes found in atomic physics or high-Q mechanical resonances, which "
"combine Gaussian (Doppler broadening, etc.) and Lorentzian (collision/natural "
"broadening, etc.) characteristics. It is calculated efficiently using the Faddeeva "
"function."
msgstr ""
"原子物理学や高 Q "
"値のメカニカル共振で見られる、ガウシアン（ドップラー広がり等）とローレンツィアン（衝突広がり・自然広がり等）が組み合わさったピーク形状を生成します。内部では "
"Faddeeva 関数を用いて効率的かつ正確に計算されます。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:45
#: e6fa4655338d4d3388a124fa27ee0dcb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Related API**: {doc}`../reference/api/noise` (`gwexpy.noise.peaks.voigt_line`)"
msgstr "**関連 API**: {doc}`../reference/api/noise` (`gwexpy.noise.peaks.voigt_line`)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:49
#: ee9e29e5c72948a894ec595077387e18
msgid "Advanced Analysis Engines and Algorithms"
msgstr "高度な解析エンジンとアルゴリズム"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:51
#: ff9983caba7a496c9b2fdccd46756ad5
msgid "1. Independent and Principal Component Analysis (ICA/PCA)"
msgstr "1. 独立成分分析・主成分分析 (ICA/PCA)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:53
#: 8f4b6bf86c90403cb451b162200d5a1f
msgid ""
"The ICA/PCA implementation in `gwexpy` provides preprocessing and metadata behavior "
"intended for physical-data workflows:"
msgstr "`gwexpy` の ICA/PCA 実装は、物理データのワークフローを想定した前処理とメタデータの扱いを提供します。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:55
#: b144ae8da7ad4707b91ecaa25f3313f5
msgid ""
"**Unit Variance Standardization**: Standardizes data to unit variance internally to "
"improve convergence, then restores (re-scales) the original physical scale after "
"computation."
msgstr "**単位分散標準化**: アルゴリズムの収束性を高めるため、内部でデータを単位分散に標準化し、演算後に元の物理スケールを復元（再スケーリング）します。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:56
#: 3ce9f7b02c034ae2993e7dc0ea4826c5
msgid ""
"**Spatio-temporal Metadata Inheritance**: Automatically inherits the GPS time "
"conventions from the input data for each statistically extracted component."
msgstr "**時空メタデータの継承**: 統計的に抽出された各成分に対し、入力データが保持していた GPS 時刻規約を自動的に継承させます。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:58
#: d9eb6ade3bc644b29efe060685d62a87
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Related API**: {doc}`../reference/api/signal` (ICA, PCA)"
msgstr "**関連 API**: {doc}`../reference/api/signal` (ICA, PCA)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:60
#: 633f044048404a819a3555573c5b374d
msgid "2. Fast Correlation Engine (:term:`Bruco`)"
msgstr "2. 高速相関計算エンジン (:term:`Bruco`)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:62
#: 86dc0c1200f3407f9e42fcdbdcddccf9
msgid ""
"The `FastCoherenceEngine` supports batch coherence scans over auxiliary channels for "
"a target signal."
msgstr "`FastCoherenceEngine` は、ターゲット信号に対する補助チャネルのコヒーレンスをバッチで走査できます。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:64
#: 7bd32a7f6fdf4306a4e388c3dd9595a4
msgid "**FFT Caching**: Reuses FFT results for a common target signal in memory."
msgstr "**FFT キャッシング**: 共通のターゲット信号に対する FFT 計算結果をメモリ内で再利用。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:65
#: 3ecce6b8d8fc421bb3a5b7de16296dac
msgid ""
"**Sparse-like Computation**: Skips non-correlated channels early to focus resources "
"on significant contributors."
msgstr "**疎行列演算**: 相関のないチャネルを早期にスキップし、計算リソースを重要チャネルに集中させます。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:67
#: 889c41fc218b4951afc5a5432da32a9f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Related API**: {doc}`../reference/api/analysis` "
"(`gwexpy.analysis.bruco.FastCoherenceEngine`)"
msgstr ""
"**関連 API**: {doc}`../reference/api/analysis` "
"(`gwexpy.analysis.bruco.FastCoherenceEngine`)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:69
#: 58d9d160fe1349228d778f44c54d2adf
msgid "3. Bayesian Inference and GLS Fitting"
msgstr "3. ベイズ推定と GLS フィッティング"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:71
#: 3f8b37cf3c90482ebc10a9336a8cdb2b
msgid "Handles parameter estimation for multidimensional data with complex error structures."
msgstr "複雑な誤差構造を持つ多次元データのパラメータ推定を行います。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:73
#: e31069972dce41108c1f59baa716e3ae
msgid ""
"**GLS (Generalized Least Squares)**: Applies statistically justified weighting when "
"bins at different frequencies have correlated (non-diagonal) covariance."
msgstr "**GLS (Generalized Least Squares)**: 各周波数点のビン間に相関（非対角の共分散）がある場合に、統計的に正当な重み付けを行います。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/physics_models.md:74
#: 958d95f4391d4a0ca95173ad783a57a8
msgid ""
"**MCMC Integration**: Uses `emcee` for posterior sampling, enabling robust fitting "
"even for non-linear physical models."
msgstr "**MCMC 統合**: `emcee` を用いた事後分布のサンプリングにより、非線形な物理モデルに対しても頑健なフィッティングが可能です。"

